


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_fd221cd6:



    voice "HIN_0206"
    hina "「怎么样？有风出来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_5be51c17:



    voice "FUM_0142"
    fumi "「是的，状态不错。哪里出问题了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_6a5b89ef:



    voice "HIN_0207"
    hina "「装在开关的螺丝钉松了所以有些接触不良。不过螺丝还留在里面，重新旋紧之后就修好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_4663328f:



    voice "FUM_0143"
    fumi "「真是厉害啊夏目同学，像电器师傅一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_ec04678b:



    voice "HIN_0208"
    hina "「没什么大不了啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_4304ab4f:



    voice "FUM_0144"
