translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_21d4a43f:



    voice "FUM_0145"
    fumi "「果然夏目同学非常可靠」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_cf154def:



    voice "HIN_0210"
    hina "「是这样吗，浅生才更能干吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_1029aa07:



    voice "FUM_0146"
    fumi "「不是的，我只会按规矩办事或者做自己熟悉的事」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_722d2da4:



    voice "FUM_0147"
    fumi "「但是夏目同学在遇到麻烦的时候都会想办法解决。所以我觉得选夏目同学做舍长果然选对了」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_07ad1c44:



    voice "HIN_0211"
    hina "「是这样吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a01_comn_10_c28f8713:



